{"words": [{"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "Then"}, {"text": "تَوَلَّيْتُم", "translation": "you turned away"}, {"text": "مِّنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ ۖ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "فَلَوْلَا", "translation": "So if not"}, {"text": "فَضْلُ", "translation": "(for the) Grace"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "upon you"}, {"text": "وَرَحْمَتُهُۥ", "translation": "and His Mercy"}, {"text": "لَكُنتُم", "translation": "surely you would have been"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْخَـٰسِرِينَ", "translation": "the losers"}], "sahih": "Then you turned away after that. And if not for the favor of Allāh upon you and His mercy, you would have been among the losers."}